<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Backdoor check-in</h1>
  <p>Vendors, field service reps and visitors: scan the QR poster at the store's backdoor with your phone camera to check in.</p>
  <a class="btn primary big" href="/login">Sign in or create an account</a>
</section>
<section class="card">
  <h2>First time here?</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li>Sign in with your <strong>company email</strong>. We send you a 6-digit code. Personal addresses (Gmail, Yahoo, Outlook) are not accepted.</li>
    <li>Verify your identity with a photo of your ID and a selfie.</li>
    <li>At the store, scan the backdoor QR code and allow location. Show the receiver your digital pass.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
